alence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.entry:frDicomQuantite.observation (Entrée Quantité)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMExposureInformation.entry.radiopharmaceuticalAdministration</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.entry:frDicomAdministrationRadiopharmaceutique.substanceAdministration (Entrée Administration des produits radiopharmaceutiques)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMExposureInformation</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-composition-document.html\">FR Composition Documentversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMExposureInformation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section (FRCompositionDocument.section:sectionExposureRadiation)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMExposureInformation.codeSection</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.code (Classification of section (recommended))</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMExposureInformation.titleSection</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.title (Label for section (e.g. for ToC))</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMExposureInformation.description</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.text (Text summary of the section, for human interpretation)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMExposureInformation.entry.quantityExposure</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.entry (FRObservationRadiationExposureDocument)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMExposureInformation.entry.radiopharmaceuticalAdministration</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Composition.section.entry (FRMedicationAdministrationDocument)</td></tr></table></div>"
